OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidespread and dense fog during
OL,6,Fthe morning will slowly dissipated.
OL,7,FMost places seeing some sunshine by
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, although cloud may
OL,9,Flinger close to the coast. Light winds
OL,10,Fall day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear spells and light winds
OL,13,Fduring the evening will allow for
OL,14,Fwidespread fog to form overnight as
OL,15,Ftemperatures drop into the single
OL,16,Ffigures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
