OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FFog affecting many areas
OL,6,Fduring the morning, clear skies
OL,7,Felsewhere. Cloud slowly sinks south,
OL,8,Faccompanied by outbreaks of rain or
OL,9,Fdrizzle, this clearing northern parts
OL,10,Fby the evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA mix
OL,13,Fof sunny spells and cloudy periods,
OL,14,Fwith showers possible at times.
OL,15,FGenerally light winds. Temperatures
OL,16,Faround average for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
